#
# ESP32-S3FN16R8 flash modules – MCU-specific modules for flash
#
# dmclk brings the CPU to 240 MHz (the tick of the RTOS counts with DMOSI_CPU_CLOCK_HZ, so it is 12 times too slow without it).
# The external RAM is the business of the board (the chip and the bus it is wired with differ: octal on the esp32s3-lcd28, quad on the
# t-deck-pro): dmpsram is in the flash.dmd of the board.
# dmgpio has a port for the ESP32-S3 (choco-technologies/dmgpio#42): add it here with the configuration of the pins of the board.
dmclk driver=board/esp32s3-lcd28.ini
#dmgpio
# dmusbserial (choco-technologies/dmusbserial) serves the USB serial port of the chip (the USB connector: /dev/ttyACM* on the host)
# and dmtty attaches a tty to it, so the shell runs there. Needs a release and an entry in dmod-registry.
dmusbserial driver=board/esp32s3-lcd28.ini
